  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Remember You Love In My Prayers**: rare: 4 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-04-13.AKG414** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 90 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **billystrings2019-04-13.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac16**: source not stated; 17 songs; 90 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [2]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says the recording has excellent sound quality [4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer considers this the best show they have heard from the Bender event [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-04-13.AKG414**: taped by Keith Antaya; transferred by Keith Antaya; source: AKG414>V3>F8 [1]\n- **billystrings2019-04-13.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps MK41V's [2]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK41V microphones placed two feet in front of the right PA stack; Chain ran into a Sound Devices MixPre-6 at 24-bit/96kHz, then edited in Sound Forge Pro 11 with iZotope dithering to 16-bit/44.1kHz; Tracked as CD WAV, then converted to FLAC using Trader's Little Helper [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Plaza Hotel Bender Jamboree - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/plaza-hotel-bender-jamboree/) [7]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Plaza Hotel Bender Jamboree - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/plaza-hotel-bender-jamboree/) [8]",
